    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89038" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέλην-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελήνη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>before the moon, older than the moon</i>, a name
			given to the Arcadians, as priding themselves on their antiquity,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				591
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hippys
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.282a
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.264
			</span></i>; expld. by other Gramm.as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑβριστικός</span>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προυσελέω</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				690.11
			</span></i>: ὁ</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
